{"id":"c-54s7ukmt","cat":"Austria","q":"Thermenregion's historic white duo, traditionally blended in Gumpoldskirchen, is:","sa":1,"accept":["zierfandler","rotgipfler","zierfandler and rotgipfler"],"ans":"Zierfandler and Rotgipfler","exp":"Rich, spicy whites south of Vienna; the region also champions St. Laurent and Pinot Noir."}
